  "ruleText": "He-M 506.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to outline the minimum qualifications and training requirements of providers and staff.\n\nSource. #2033, eff 6-7-82; ss by #2679, eff 4-18-84; ss by #5047, eff 1-18-91, EXPIRED: 1-18-97\n\nNew. #6645, eff 12-2-97, EXPIRED: 12-2-05\n\nNew. #8604, eff 4-11-06; ss by #10528, eff 3-1-14; ss by #14039, eff 8-1-24",
